  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u80ed65d9\" id=\"u80ed65d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d0ab2d1\" id=\"u5d0ab2d1\">本节内容主要讲解gpio的两个基础功能,分别为</span></p><ol list=\"u8b489fef\"><li fid=\"u119072dd\" data-lake-id=\"u0b8236ed\" id=\"u0b8236ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua96a1426\" id=\"ua96a1426\">gpio输出: 控制引脚电平状态</span></li><li fid=\"u119072dd\" data-lake-id=\"u5d3aea10\" id=\"u5d3aea10\"><span data-lake-id=\"uedd25183\" id=\"uedd25183\">gpio输入: 读取引脚当前电平状态</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u8f847bbb\" id=\"u8f847bbb\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u75eace39\" id=\"u75eace39\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4aaecf3\" id=\"uf4aaecf3\">核心板原理图</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"localdoc\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpdf%2F27903758%2F1742054043444-35ac38c5-0b31-48be-a35a-9f913bd49199.pdf%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22SCH_ESP32_S3.pdf%22%2C%22size%22%3A382173%2C%22ext%22%3A%22pdf%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udede403c-d706-4dbb-8013-29d9dce2043%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22transfer%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fpdf%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nox4l%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7dd890de\" id=\"u7dd890de\"><span data-lake-id=\"u042dc291\" id=\"u042dc291\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"AW4KF\" id=\"AW4KF\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12586c3c\" id=\"u12586c3c\">gpio输出:点灯大师</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"thirdparty\" alias=\"bilibili\" value=\"data:%7B%22entrance%22%3A%22bilibili%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.bilibili.com%2Fplayer.html%3Fbvid%3DBV1choKYKEb4%26p%3D2%26page%3D2%26autoplay%3D0%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.bilibili.com%2Fplayer.html%3Fbvid%3DBV1choKYKEb4%26p%3D2%26page%3D2%26autoplay%3D0%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22bilibili%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oUeBP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf07bd4e8\" id=\"uf07bd4e8\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1728282876148-36920209-94b6-4f67-8d83-51858160c3f7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u93ddf82e-4e57-4aa6-987c-f1bb6a1e0a6%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u71511498-cd1f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A310.4%2C%22height%22%3A91%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A8317%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A388%2C%22originHeight%22%3A114%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPIO48%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LED1%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2215K0%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R25%22%2C%22x%22%3A166%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf6f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9eeb6b8f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u79355cf0\" id=\"u79355cf0\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46c21c67\" id=\"u46c21c67\">我们通过点亮开发板上面的灯来快速学习GPIO的输出,通过上面的原理图我们知道,只要48号引脚输出低电平,LED灯就可以亮起</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1d20cc34\" id=\"u1d20cc34\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"sDkev\" id=\"sDkev\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b999369\" id=\"u2b999369\">点亮灯</span></h3><ol list=\"u19fe0544\"><li fid=\"ubad78aa2\" data-lake-id=\"u05319262\" id=\"u05319262\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79524f60\" id=\"u79524f60\">导包</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Pin%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gnQr2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u19fe0544\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ubad78aa2\" data-lake-id=\"uf089c56e\" id=\"uf089c56e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8eaebf7\" id=\"ud8eaebf7\">驱动电平</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p48%20%3D%20Pin(48%2CPin.OUT)%5Cnp48.off()%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CSeAH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub79be6c6\" id=\"ub79be6c6\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"MCyNj\" id=\"MCyNj\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufca1f2e7\" id=\"ufca1f2e7\">闪烁的灯</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u698d08e1\" id=\"u698d08e1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c92c964\" id=\"u3c92c964\">顾名思义,就是让灯一闪一闪,我们只要将灯点亮,延迟一定的时间之后关闭, 再延迟一定的时间再亮起, 我们就可以实现灯的亮灭操作.</span></p><ol list=\"u3e5fe5d2\"><li fid=\"u66eaaa4a\" data-lake-id=\"u82d2616d\" id=\"u82d2616d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub88ca620\" id=\"ub88ca620\">导包</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Pin%5Cnimport%20time%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KD7iH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u39c2330d\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uadd0d190\" data-lake-id=\"u833d33e6\" id=\"u833d33e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0717faf1\" id=\"u0717faf1\">初始化引脚</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p48%20%3D%20Pin(48%2CPin.OUT)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22noEto%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u67834fb3\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ue3ed8a6e\" data-lake-id=\"u8b3fec12\" id=\"u8b3fec12\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3f57d18\" id=\"ua3f57d18\">编写驱动逻辑</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22while%20True%20%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20p48.off()%5Cn%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20p48.on()%5Cn%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ugcef%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue0e95549\" id=\"ue0e95549\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u22c48d0c\" id=\"u22c48d0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1109ae8\" id=\"ua1109ae8\">总结：点灯操作虽然简单，但是它几乎是每一个电子设备上面都能看到的功能，学会了点灯，我们就可以利用代码去控制很多设备。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"mEGgQ\" id=\"mEGgQ\"><br></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue01898d9\" id=\"ue01898d9\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Bjatq\" id=\"Bjatq\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc059f95\" id=\"ufc059f95\">gpio输入: 按键状态读取</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"thirdparty\" alias=\"bilibili\" value=\"data:%7B%22entrance%22%3A%22bilibili%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.bilibili.com%2Fplayer.html%3Fbvid%3DBV1choKYKEb4%26p%3D3%26page%3D3%26autoplay%3D0%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.bilibili.com%2Fplayer.html%3Fbvid%3DBV1choKYKEb4%26p%3D3%26page%3D3%26autoplay%3D0%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22bilibili%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ho7lq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2ec9d6a6\" id=\"u2ec9d6a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a0145f4\" id=\"u5a0145f4\">gpio的输入主要是让我们可以通过代码去获取设备的状态，信息等，以便于我们可以感知外部的物理世界。下面我们通过案件的例子来获取外部物理世界的变化。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud9f10556\" id=\"ud9f10556\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1728285762781-3d8ccf17-6b82-4ce1-b5c4-03c2f2d45c63.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udd97ae6a-f199-457b-9fb1-07cd06b7d77%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u71511498-cd1f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A362.4%2C%22height%22%3A177%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A13886%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A453%2C%22originHeight%22%3A221%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22BOOT1%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224.7K0%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A4%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A95%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPIOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R14%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A194%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223V3%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A4%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc504ba37%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1edd09d9\" id=\"u1edd09d9\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb543160\" id=\"ueb543160\">仔细阅读上面原理图,我们不难看出GPIO0的默认电平是3v3, 属于高电平. 当我们将按键按下的时候,  GPIO0接到了GND, 此时它的电平将会是低电平.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua724452f\" id=\"ua724452f\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2814f69\" id=\"ub2814f69\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u78583973\" id=\"u78583973\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"udecb620b\" id=\"udecb620b\">我们可以采用GPIO输入的方式来读取GPIO0引脚当前的状态</span></p><ol list=\"uc7048e94\"><li fid=\"u0eb3cfb3\" data-lake-id=\"ud4bcafa5\" id=\"ud4bcafa5\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95270025\" id=\"u95270025\">导包</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Pin%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EDl2j%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"uc7048e94\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u0eb3cfb3\" data-lake-id=\"u68106827\" id=\"u68106827\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f9f4a47\" id=\"u0f9f4a47\">初始化引脚，</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5CnKEY%3DPin(0%2CPin.IN)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22niBNt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"uc7048e94\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u0eb3cfb3\" data-lake-id=\"ua25f5757\" id=\"ua25f5757\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u737f5000\" id=\"u737f5000\">读取值</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%2C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E0%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E4%BD%8E%E7%94%B5%E5%B9%B3%2C1%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E9%AB%98%E7%94%B5%E5%B9%B3%5CnKEY.value()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jBGOE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3aff996b\" id=\"u3aff996b\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u36125e31\" id=\"u36125e31\"><span data-lake-id=\"u965dbb56\" id=\"u965dbb56\">总结：gpio的输入，是我们利用电子设备去捕获外部世界状态的变化，它也是我们嵌入式开发中非常常见的功能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uae114aba\" id=\"uae114aba\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac237fe3\" id=\"uac237fe3\">​</span><br></p>",
